From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000001 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tab S9 FE Linux Project <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ANDROID: arm64: gts9fe: enable Linux early userspace

The shipping Android configuration has initrd support but deliberately leaves
devtmpfs and virtual terminals disabled.  A standalone Linux initramfs needs a
populated /dev and benefits from a rescue console before Android userspace or
udev is available.

Enable the minimum facilities used by the project's diagnostic initramfs.  No
storage write policy or security bypass is changed here.

Signed-off-by: Tab S9 FE Linux Project <noreply@example.invalid>
---
 arch/arm64/configs/s5e8835-gts9fexx_defconfig | 14 +++++++++-----
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/s5e8835-gts9fexx_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/s5e8835-gts9fexx_defconfig
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/s5e8835-gts9fexx_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/s5e8835-gts9fexx_defconfig
@@ -233,3 +233,3 @@
 # CONFIG_SYSFS_SYSCALL is not set
-# CONFIG_FHANDLE is not set
+CONFIG_FHANDLE=y
 CONFIG_POSIX_TIMERS=y
@@ -1775,3 +1775,4 @@
 # CONFIG_UEVENT_HELPER is not set
-# CONFIG_DEVTMPFS is not set
+CONFIG_DEVTMPFS=y
+CONFIG_DEVTMPFS_MOUNT=y
 CONFIG_STANDALONE=y
@@ -2969,3 +2970,6 @@
 CONFIG_TTY=y
-# CONFIG_VT is not set
+CONFIG_VT=y
+CONFIG_CONSOLE_TRANSLATIONS=y
+CONFIG_VT_CONSOLE=y
+CONFIG_VT_HW_CONSOLE_BINDING=y
 CONFIG_UNIX98_PTYS=y
@@ -7681,4 +7685,4 @@
 CONFIG_TMPFS=y
-# CONFIG_TMPFS_POSIX_ACL is not set
-# CONFIG_TMPFS_XATTR is not set
+CONFIG_TMPFS_POSIX_ACL=y
+CONFIG_TMPFS_XATTR=y
 # CONFIG_TMPFS_INODE64 is not set
-- 
2.50.1
